<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA OUT FOR 185 IN SECOND INNINGS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA OUT FOR 185 IN SECOND INNINGS.</headline>
<dateline>PRETORIA 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia were bowled out for 185 in their second innings by South Africa on the fourth day of the third and final cricket test at Centurion Park on Monday leaving the home side needing 29 runs for victory.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 227 and 185 (Steve Waugh 60 not out, Allan Donald 5-36), South Africa 384.</p>
